{
	"name": "Shadower",
	"type": "culture",
	"img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-robe-evil-glow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Stealthy Shadow.</strong> The time spent skulking about the shadow plane to avoid its dangers serves you well even on the Material Plane. You are proficient in Stealth.</p><p><strong>The Power of Observation.</strong> You’ve learned how to glean lots of information quickly. Your Passive Perception score increases by 5, and you gain an expertise die on Perception checks.</p><p><strong>Coalesced Knowledge.</strong> You leverage the collected knowledge of your fellow shadowers to your advantage. Whenever you critically succeed on an Investigation check, you gain a piece of Key Knowledge related to that subject.</p><p><strong>Languages.</strong> You can speak, read, write, and sign Common and one other language of your choosing. This language should reflect one known by your counterpart.</p>",
